ItemDisplay[EQUIPPED (AMAZON OR ASSASSIN OR BARBARIAN) SHIELD]:%NAME%{%NAME%%CL%%WHITE%Max Block Dex: $f(CEIL(CHARSTAT12*150/(CHARSTAT20+25)+15))}%CONTINUE%//
ItemDisplay[EQUIPPED (DRUID OR NECROMANCER OR SORCERESS) SHIELD]:%NAME%{%NAME%%CL%%WHITE%Max Block Dex: $f(CEIL(CHARSTAT12*150/(CHARSTAT20+20)+15))}%CONTINUE%//

